0..38 Comment "//! This source shows grade-one holds."
39..42 Comment "//!"
43..78 Comment "//! A grade-one hold has one owner."
79..128 Comment "//! Its value does not copy while the hold lives."
129..132 Comment "//!"
133..180 Comment "//! An exclusive view transfers the value once."
181..220 Comment "//! `resume` writes the new value back."
221..289 Comment "//! The write-back needs no count of the other holders of the value."
290..336 Comment "//! The grades are those of graded modal types"
337..406 Comment "//! [Orchard-2019-quantitative_program_reasoning_graded_modal_types]."
407..410 Comment "//!"
411..488 Comment "//! - cites: [Orchard-2019-quantitative_program_reasoning_graded_modal_types]"
